    "notes": "placement is a pipeline that turns one position per chunk into the positions where msm_examples:poppy runs. rarity_filter keeps one chunk in four, in_square moves to a random spot, heightmap lifts it to the surface, then count and offset spread 32 tries around it. block_predicate_filter keeps tries in air and biome keeps those inside biomes that list msm_examples:poppy_patch. Add it to a biome's vegetal decoration list to use it.",
